      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4008081496005786401, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalEulerAnglesHint.z
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueTextUI
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 911260277}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: typewriterDelay
      value: 0.043
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: branch12.Array.size
      value: 50
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[1]'
      value: "une jeune \xE2me s\u2019avan\xE7ant d\xE9termin\xE9e vers le ch\xE2teau,"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[2]'
      value: "qui se dressait alors fi\xE8rement sur la colline."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[4]'
      value: Le squelette.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[5]'
      value: "Autrefois, Oswald de son nom, \xE9tait un bandit r\xE9put\xE9 pour
        ses embuscades sur les routes de la contr\xE9e."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[6]'
      value: "Ni h\xE9ros ni monstre, simplement un homme qui vivait du malheur des
        autres, entour\xE9 de son petit groupe de voleurs."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[7]'
      value: "Mais un jour, leurs m\xE9faits all\xE8rent trop loin."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[8]'
      value: "Et un groupe de chevaliers fut d\xE9p\xEAch\xE9 par le roi afin de
        les \xE9liminer."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[9]'
      value: "L'affrontement fut bref, les chevaliers, bien plus nombreux et mieux
        entra\xEEn\xE9s, parvinrent sans mal \xE0 venir \xE0 bout de la troupe de
        bandits."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[10]'
      value: "Et Oswald fut alors tu\xE9 dans la disgr\xE2ce la plus absolue. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[11]'
      value: "Son corps laiss\xE9 \xE0 l\u2019abandon au beau milieu de la for\xEAt."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[12]'
      value: 'Avec le temps, la pluie et la terre eurent raison de sa chair. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[13]'
      value: Ne restant plus que des os, ensevelis dans le sol.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[14]'
      value: "Seulement, un si\xE8cle apr\xE8s sa mort, un ph\xE9nom\xE8ne inattendu
        eut lieu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[15]'
      value: Un mouvement sembla se manifester sous terre.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[16]'
      value: "Les os, rest\xE9s intacts depuis toutes ces ann\xE9es, se mirent \xE0
        bouger \xE0 nouveau."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[17]'
      value: "Un r\xE9veil soudain d\u2019Oswald, qui d\xE9gagea alors son corps
        squelettique enseveli sous cet amas de terre,"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[18]'
      value: "avant de reprendre sa route d\xE9termin\xE9e, anim\xE9 par son sentiment
        de vengeance."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[19]'
      value: "Malgr\xE9 ces mauvaises rencontres,"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[20]'
      value: "cela n\u2019avait pas d\xE9courag\xE9 pour autant notre personnage
        dans sa qu\xEAte, qui \xE9tait enfin parvenu \xE0 quitter la for\xEAt."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[21]'
      value: "Laissant \xE0 pr\xE9sent se d\xE9voiler devant lui un petit village."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[22]'
      value: "Et \xE0 peine arriv\xE9, ce dernier fut directement attir\xE9 par le
        son des mart\xE8lements r\xE9p\xE9t\xE9s, le menant \xE0 la forge du village,"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[23]'
      value: "qui, curieux de savoir ce qu\u2019il pouvait bien se procurer, interpella
        le forgeron afin de lui demander..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[24]'
      value: "Une \xE9p\xE9e."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[25]'
      value: "\xE0 peine fit-il part de sa demande, que le forgeron, alors attel\xE9
        sur son \xE9tabli, releva la t\xEAte afin de faire face \xE0 son client."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[26]'
      value: "Seulement, \xE0 la vue du squelette, ce dernier se figea aussit\xF4t."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[27]'
      value: "Choqu\xE9 et terrifi\xE9 de se retrouver face \xE0 un mort-vivant."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[28]'
      value: "Le squelette en profita pour subtiliser la lame, alors visible sur
        l\u2019\xE9tabli du forgeron, avant de repartir du village"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[29]'
      value: "Il prit un malin plaisir \xE0 terrifier les villageois qu'il croisait,
        parfaitement indiff\xE9rent \xE0 la panique qu\u2019il semait."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[30]'
      value: "Et c\u2019est ainsi, au pas lent et sans un regard en arri\xE8re, que
        le squelette quitta le village, laissant derri\xE8re lui un silence lourd."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[31]'
      value: "\xC0 pr\xE9sent \xE9quip\xE9 et par\xE9, notre personnage put enfin
        entamer la derni\xE8re \xE9tape de son p\xE9riple, en entreprenant la mont\xE9e
        de la colline menant au ch\xE2teau."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[32]'
      value: "Et ainsi, au fur et \xE0 mesure de son avanc\xE9e, les tours semblaient
        se dresser majestueusement devant lui."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[33]'
      value: "Mais alors qu\u2019il se trouvait \xE0 pr\xE9sent \xE0 deux pas de
        la porte du ch\xE2teau, il aper\xE7ut une silhouette, celle..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[34]'
      value: De la chevaleresse
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[35]'
      value: "Arm\xE9 de son \xE9p\xE9e vol\xE9e, le squelette fut interpell\xE9
        par la Chevaleresse depuis le haut des remparts : "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[36]'
      value: "\u2014 Toi, vile cr\xE9ature devant nos portes\u2026 que viens-tu faire
        ici ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[37]'
      value: "Le Squelette leva son cr\xE2ne dans sa direction, avant de lui r\xE9torquer
        : "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[38]'
      value: "\u2014 Je viens me venger contre vous, chevaliers, vos anc\xEAtres
        m\u2019ayant massacr\xE9 il y a cent ans de cela."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[39]'
      value: "La Chevaleresse empoigna son \xE9p\xE9e en la sortant de son fourreau."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[40]'
      value: "\u2014 Je suis navr\xE9e pour toi, mais ceux qui t\u2019ont fait du
        tort ne sont plus de ce monde. Tu aurais d\xFB rester parmi les morts."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[41]'
      value: "\u2014 S\u2019ils ne sont plus l\xE0\u2026 alors c\u2019est sur toi
        que je passerai ma col\xE8re."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[42]'
      value: "Sans h\xE9siter face \xE0 la d\xE9termination du squelette, la Chevaleresse
        sauta depuis les murailles et atterrit devant lui."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[43]'
      value: "Elle ne montra aucune peur \xE0 l\u2019\xE9gard de ce dernier, le d\xE9fiant
        directement en le regardant droit dans ses orbites vides."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[44]'
      value: "\xC0 la suite de quoi, les deux d\xE9but\xE8rent un combat acharn\xE9
        : la Chevaleresse tranchant les os du Squelette, qui ne cessaient de se reformer
        \xE0 chaque coup.Rien ne semblait pouvoir l\u2019arr\xEAter."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[45]'
      value: "Ainsi le duel s\u2019\xE9ternisa durant un jour et une nuit."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[46]'
      value: "Mais alors que les forces de la Chevaleresse touchaient \xE0 leur fin,
        cette derni\xE8re parvint \xE0 pi\xE9ger le Squelette et \xE0 le ma\xEEtriser"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[47]'
      value: "jetant ainsi ce dernier dans les cachots du ch\xE2teau."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[48]'
      value: "Il y resta des centaines d\u2019ann\xE9es, prisonnier des barreaux,
        enferm\xE9 dans l\u2019obscurit\xE9 absolue."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5940439431317087825, guid: a626a0850a91ac742940f13c78252877, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'branch12.Array.data[49]'
      value: "Aucun visiteur. Aucun son. Rien d\u2019autre que l\u2019\xE9coulement
